name: Fresh Setup, accepted Map, bounded passes, partial report, deliberate resume and restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/investigation_journey.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 READY THE MAP RUN | fresh-setup
keys: Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Build threat model | map-selection
keys: Down Down Down Space Enter
require-live-snap: 20 READY THE MAP RUN | selected-map-work
expect: APPROVAL NEXT
ask: Does a fresh target show the selected deterministic preparation, model-backed context, real credential state and explicit allowance requirement before any work?
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 GENERATE STUDY CONTEXT | map-plan
expect: 3 fixed jobs
keys: t
type: 5
keys: Enter r
type: 2
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | frozen-map
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/investigation_journey.py @TMP_TARGET @ART map-draft
ask: Does preparing Map freeze its three real jobs, one worker and a five-call shared allowance with two protected for Review, without starting a request?
keys: Enter End
require-live-snap: 25 y approve | map-approval
expect: 3 fixed jobs
expect: Total provider calls: 5
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Open approved Map jobs | approved-map
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 L starts the approved jobs | map-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | map-running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/investigation_journey.py @TMP_TARGET @ART map-completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 3 job(s) · 3 completed | map-completed
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | generated-context
keys: m
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | map-result-loading
require-live-snap: 30 Rust greeting writer | pending-map
ask: Does the executed producer chain reach a source-grounded Map for explicit acceptance, with no injected completed queue, finding or global context activation?
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/investigation_journey.py @TMP_TARGET @ART map-accepted
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | discovery-plan
expect: 1 committed / 5 total
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE DISCOVERY ENGINES | discovery-engines
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Space
require-live-snap: 20 [x] agentic | selected-agentic-engine
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Engine choices updated | applied-discovery-engine
ask: Does discovery inherit the exact accepted context and existing accounting while offering three fresh passes and one worker for review?
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | frozen-discovery
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/investigation_journey.py @TMP_TARGET @ART scan-draft
keys: Down NPage NPage NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 25 Supporting context: no supplemental text | frozen-supporting-context
ask: Can the operator read the supporting-context omission before approval, with the exact frozen scan options and no hidden live supplementation?
keys: Up
keys: L End
require-live-snap: 25 y approve | discovery-approval
expect: 3 fixed jobs
expect: Total provider calls: 5
expect: Protected review calls: 2
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved-discovery
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/investigation_journey.py @TMP_TARGET @ART scan-approved
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | discovery-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | discovery-running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/investigation_journey.py @TMP_TARGET @ART partial
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 2 completed | stopped-at-limit
expect: 1 parked
ask: Does the approved plan stop with two completed passes and one parked pass, preserving the two Review calls without cap doubling, new jobs or a completeness claim?
keys: L
require-live-snap: 20 allowance exhausted | refused-unapproved-resume
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/investigation_journey.py @TMP_TARGET @ART refused
