live-snap: refused-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: refused-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: refused-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: refused-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 allowance exhausted | refused-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 20 allowance exhausted | refused-paged-40x12
ask: Does the blocked action remain visible while paging and resizing, with full details reachable and no focus, draft, job or spending change?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT partial | partial-scan
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 partial acknowledged | accepted-partial
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/open-recurring.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Labeled recurring observation | recurring-finding
submit: dismiss false_positive Labeled synthetic greeting; no defect is claimed
require-live-snap: 25 rejected_false_positive | false-positive-decision
paste-file: @ART/open-later-only.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Labeled later-only observation | second-finding
submit: decision deferred Labeled offline workflow decision; retain raw observations
require-live-snap: 25 deferred | deferred-decision
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 3 committed / 5 calls | partial-report
expect: 2 reviewed
expect: 2 protected review remaining
expect: 3 producer observations
expect: 1 pending
keys: Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 25 json · all | partial-json-selection
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 json · 2 finding(s) | partial-export
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/investigation_journey.py @TMP_TARGET @ART partial-report
ask: Can the operator finish and export partial work with durable FP and deferral decisions, raw provenance, honest recurrence and unknown dollars while Review remains protected?
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/scan-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 2 completed | existing-fixed-jobs
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | retained-study
keys: Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Total calls | revise-specific-allowance
type: 6
keys: Enter L End
require-live-snap: 25 y approve | specific-new-approval
expect: Total provider calls: 6
expect: Protected review calls: 2
expect: 3 fixed jobs
ask: Does the six-call revision retain previous spending and the same three jobs, with exactly one new discovery call available and a separate approval decision?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | revised-approved
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 Plan approved | remaining-job-approved
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | remaining-job-running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/investigation_journey.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 3 completed | original-plan-completed
ask: Does explicit resume run only the original remaining pass, preserve prior attempts and decisions, and keep a missed nondeterministic observation separate from a fix?
keys: Escape
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 RESULT READY | completed-scan
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 result selected | accepted-complete
keys: Escape
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 1 reviewed | rediscovered-decision-needs-reassessment
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/open-later-only.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Labeled later-only observation | rediscovered-finding
require-live-snap: 25 Later source identity is unverified | rediscovered-source-unverified
ask: Does the rediscovered observation retain the prior deferral but request reassessment because a dirty commit alone cannot establish unchanged source?
submit: decision deferred Reassessed the owned fixture after pass 3
require-live-snap: 25 deferred | reassessed-deferral
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 4 committed / 6 calls | final-report
expect: 4 producer observations
expect: 2 protected review remaining
require-live-snap: 25 2 reviewed | final-reviewed-report
require-live-snap: 25 json · all | final-json-selection
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 json · 2 finding(s) | final-export
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/investigation_journey.py @TMP_TARGET @ART final-report
