keys: End
live-snap: report-controls-40x12
ask: Is the final scoped report readable by paging at all six sizes, with model, source, raw observations, spending, review limits and export controls reachable?
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 25 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | exit-confirmation
expect: no active work
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 4 committed / 6 calls | recovered-report
expect: 2 reviewed
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/investigation_journey.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restart
ask: Does no-color restart recover the accepted context, completed original jobs, both human decisions and shared consumption without another request or new investigation?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
